      "id": "kf_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -264
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Kaleidoscope slime\n\nThe Symmetry node in `kaleidoscope` mode: a slime mould simulation's trail map, cut to one wedge and mirrored round the centre `count` times — six mirrors, twelve copies, meeting edge to edge like a real kaleidoscope (`clip`). The veins grow into a lace mandala.\n\nTry `rotate` (turns only), another `count`, or wire any other layer in.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 200
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Kaleidoscope slime\n\nThe Symmetry node in `kaleidoscope` mode: a slime mould simulation's trail map, cut to one wedge and mirrored round the centre `count` times — six mirrors, twelve copies, meeting edge to edge like a real kaleidoscope (`clip`). The veins grow into a lace mandala.\n\nTry `rotate` (turns only), another `count`, or wire any other layer in.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 200
      }
    },
